  m_Text: "\u2022 <b>WASD / Y\xF6n tu\u015Flar\u0131:</b> hareket (topa uzakken ko\u015Fars\u0131n)\n\u2022
    Topu s\xFCrerek ya da <b>SPACE</b> ile \u015Fut \xE7ekerek kalelere sok\n\u2022
    Sar\u0131 defans mankenleri sa\u011Fa sola kay\u0131p yolu keser\n\u2022 Sahadaki
    toplar bitince sar\u0131 ok mahalledeki toplar\u0131 g\xF6sterir\n\u2022 <b>ESC:</b>
    oyunu duraklat"
